| `Received` ok for a call | `Completed(value)` | Ready |
| `Received` RPC error for a call | `Rejected(RPC error text)` | Ready |
| `Received` invalid envelope for a call | `Failed` | Failed |
| `Close` in Ready | `Send(shutdown, next id)` | ShuttingDown |
| `Received` ok for shutdown | `ShutDown` | Stopped |
| `Received` error for shutdown | `Failed` | Failed |
| `Received` with nothing in flight | `Failed` | Failed |
| `Call` in any other state | `Rejected(State)` | unchanged |
